    <footer class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full text-center text-[11px] text-gray-600 font-mono mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-gray-900">
        Blackwood Answering Machine &bull; Model T-300 &bull; Audio Horror Interactive Game
